) = 7.\n- **Ten-millions place:** 3 + 2 = 5.\n- **Hundred-millions place:** 1 + 8 = 9.\n\n4. **Combine the results:**.\n\n```.\n  957,602,869.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '757602869'}
