n    --------------.\n      878,191,918.\n```.\n\n3. **Detailed addition:**.\n\n- **Ones place:** 2 + 6 = 8.\n- **Tens place:** 3 + 8 = 11 (Write down 1, carry over 1).\n- **Hundreds place:** 3 + 5 + 1 (carry) = 9.\n- **Thousands place:** 2 + 9 = 11 (Write down 1, carry over 1).\n- **Ten-thousands place:** 9 + 9 + 1 (carry) = 19 (Write down 9, carry over 1).\n- **Hundred-thousands place:** 3 + 7 + 1 (carry) = 11 (Write down 1, carry over 1).\n- **Millions place:** 6 + 1 + 1 (carry) = 8.\n- **Ten-millions place:** 8 + 9 = 17 (Write down 7, carry over 1).\n- **Hundred-millions place:** 3 + 4 + 1 (carry) = 8.\n\n4. **Combine the results:**.\n\n```.\n  386,392,332.\n+ 491,799,586.\n--------------.\n  878,191,918.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '828191918'}
