5,668.\n  + 404,993,616.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 1 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 3 = 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 9 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n5. **Ten thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 7\\)  .\n   Write down **7**.\n\n6. **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 9 = 18\\)  .\n   Write down **8** and carry over **1**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 2\\)  .\n   Write down **2**.\n\n8. **Ten millions place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 4 = 7\\)  .\n   Write down **7**.\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '704919284'} 30%|###       | 151/500 [14:51<43:36,  7.50s/it]
