 the left.\n\n```.\n    713,356,439.\n  + 505,012,956.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 6 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 5 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 2 = 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 9 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n5. **Ten thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 1 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 7\\)  .\n   Write down **7**.\n\n6. **Hundred thousands place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 0 = 3\\)  .\n   Write down **3**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 5 = 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\n8. **Ten millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 0 = 7\\)  .\n   Write down **7**.\n\n9. **Hundred millions place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 5 = 5\\)  .\n   Write down **5**.\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n```.\n  1,218,369,395.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1918369395'}
