arting from the rightmost digit (ones place):**.\n\n```.\n      7 + 2 = 9.\n     5 + 6 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1).\n    2 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 5.\n    8 + 7 = 15 (write down 5, carry over 1).\n    4 + 6 + 1 (carry) = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1).\n    6 + 2 + 1 (carry) = 9.\n    1 + 2 = 3.\n    1 + 4 = 5.\n```.\n\n3. **Combine the results:**.\n\n```.\n  110,648,257.\n+ 412,267,262.\n--------------.\n  522,915,519.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '522915517'}
