``.\n    770,876,131.\n  + 298,223,673.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 3 = 4\\).\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 7 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 6 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 3 = 9\\).\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 2 = 9\\).\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 8 = 16\\)  .\n   Write down **6** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\).\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1089099804'} 70%|######9   | 348/500 [34:20<14:03,  5.55s/it]
