 sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{971,671,781}\n\\]", 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking': '\nFirst, I will align the two numbers by their place values to ensure accurate addition.\n\nNext, I will add the digits starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and move to the left.\n\nIf the sum of any two digits exceeds 9, I will carry over the extra value to the next higher place value.\n\nI will continue this process for each place value until all digits have been added.\n\nFinally, I will compile the results to obtain the final sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_answer': '971671781', 'cot0shot.math teacher_result': True, 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking_CoT': '\nFirst, I will align the two numbers by their place values to ensure accurate addition.\n\nNext, I will add the digits starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and move to the left.\n\nIf the sum of any two digits exceeds 9, I will carry over the extra value to the next higher place value.\n\nI will continue this process for each place value until all digits have been added.\n\nFinally, I will compile the results to obtain the final sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_output_CoT': ".\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the sum of **737,315,520** and **234,356,261**?.\n\n# Reasoning:.\n\nLet's add the two numbers digit by digit, starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\n```.\n    737,315,520.\n  + 234,356,261.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 1 = 1\\).\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 6 = 8\\).\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 2 = 7\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 6 = 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(1 + 5 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 7\\).\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 3 = 6\\).\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 4 = 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \