:**  .\n   \\(4 + 2 = 6\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 4 = 6\\).\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 7 = 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\).\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 7 = 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\).\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '0308036688'}
