ce:**  \n   \\(6 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 9\\)\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  \n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  \n   Write down **4** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  \n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\)\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,492,679,348}\n\\]", 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking': '\nFirst, I will write down the two numbers to be added: 867,842,048 and 624,837,300.\n\nNext, I will align the numbers by their place values to ensure each digit is added correctly.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit, I will add each corresponding pair of digits, carrying over any excess to the next higher place value as needed.\n\nI will proceed through each place value—ones, tens, hundreds, and so on—until all digits have been added.\n\nFinally, I will compile the results of each addition to determine the total sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_answer': '1492679348', 'cot0shot.math teacher_result': True, 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking_CoT': '\nFirst, I will write down the two numbers to be added: 867,842,048 and 624,837,300.\n\nNext, I will align the numbers by their place values to ensure each digit is added correctly.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit, I will add each corresponding pair of digits, carrying over any excess to the next higher place value as needed.\n\nI will proceed through each place value—ones, tens, hundreds, and so on—until all digits have been added.\n\nFinally, I will compile the results of each addition to determine the total sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_output_CoT': ".\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the sum of 867,842,048 and 624,837,300?.\n\n# Reasoning:.\n\nLet's add the two numbers digit by digit, starting from the rightmost digit (ones place) and moving to the left.\n\n```.\n    867,842,048.\n  + 624,837,300.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 0 = 8\\).\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 0 = 4\\).\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 3 = 3\\).\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 7 = 9\\).\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 8 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 3 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 4 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 2 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 9\\).\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\).\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1492671348'} 79%|#######9  | 395/500 [38:42<09:55,  5.68s/it]
