, until I have added all the digits.\n\nFinally, after completing the addition for all place values, I will arrive at the final sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_output_CoT': ".\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the sum of 976,642,949 and 374,119,888?.\n\n# Reasoning:.\n\nLet's add the two numbers digit by digit, starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\n```.\n    976,642,949.\n  + 374,119,888.\n  ==============.\n```.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 8 = 17\\)  .\n   Write down **7** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 8 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 19\\)  .\n   Write down **9** and carry over **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 1 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 4\\)  .\n   Write down **4**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 9 = 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 1 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 4 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 7 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 15\\)  .\n   Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 3 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  .\n    The carryover **1** is written down.\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:.\n\n# Answer:.\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1350762867'}
