ace:** \\(2 + 8 = 10\\) (Write down 0 and carry over 1).\n- **Ten-millions place:** \\(1 + 7 + 1 (carry) = 9\\).\n\n4. **Combine the results:**.\n\n```.\n        1 2 3 1 0 0 5 6 5.\n      + 7 8 2 2 3 6 3 3 3.\n      -----------------------.\n        9 0 5 3 3 6 9 0 8.\n```.\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '905336498'} 90%|######### | 450/500 [43:44<04:30,  5.41s/it]
