.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 7 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 7 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 9 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 17\\)  .\n   Write down **7** and carry over **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 7 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 4 = 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 1 = 3\\)  .\n   Write down **3**.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 0 = 5\\)  .\n   Write down **5**.\n\n8. **Ten-millions place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1**.\n\n9. **Hundred-millions place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\)  .\n   Write down **1**.\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1615398144'}
