carry) \\(= 16\\)  \n   Write down **6** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n9. **Hundred millions place:**  \n   \\(8 + 8 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 17\\)  \n   Write down **7** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n10. **Billions place:**  \n    \\(0 + 0 + 1\\) (carry) \\(= 1\\)\n\nPutting it all together, the final sum is:\n\n# Answer:\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,764,183,795}\n\\]", 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking': '\nFirst, I will write down the two numbers to be added: 899,541,032 and 864,642,763.\n\nNext, I will align the numbers by their place values to ensure each digit is added correctly.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit (the ones place), I will add each corresponding pair of digits. If the sum of any pair exceeds 9, I will carry over the extra value to the next higher place value.\n\nI will proceed to add the digits in the tens, hundreds, thousands, ten thousands, hundred thousands, millions, ten millions, hundred millions, and billions places, carrying over as needed.\n\nAfter adding all the digits and handling any necessary carries, I will arrive at the final sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_answer': '1764183795', 'cot0shot.math teacher_result': True, 'cot0shot.math teacher_thinking_CoT': '\nFirst, I will write down the two numbers to be added: 899,541,032 and 864,642,763.\n\nNext, I will align the numbers by their place values to ensure each digit is added correctly.\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit (the ones place), I will add each corresponding pair of digits. If the sum of any pair exceeds 9, I will carry over the extra value to the next higher place value.\n\nI will proceed to add the digits in the tens, hundreds, thousands, ten thousands, hundred thousands, millions, ten millions, hundred millions, and billions places, carrying over as needed.\n\nAfter adding all the digits and handling any necessary carries, I will arrive at the final sum.\n', 'cot0shot.math teacher_output_CoT': ".\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the sum of 899,541,032 and 864,642,763?.